WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Advertising your business shouldn't mean learning a complicated ad manager.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:11.300
Start with your website. MAIRO reads your public pages, and ticks each step only when it's done.

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.500
It shows what it understood — facts kept apart from its suggestions.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Your free plan: more online sales, with $1,000 a month divided across your campaign. A plan, not a forecast.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.400
Ad concepts are free, and every word is yours to change.

6
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:35.600
With a subscription, MAIRO makes the finished picture — one credit, used only if it's made.

7
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.200
Subscribe, and connect your own Meta ad account. Ad spend goes to Meta, separately.

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.300
MAIRO builds the campaign as a draft, starting from your plan.

9
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:50.200
Nothing runs until you approve it — and it's shown live only once Meta confirms.

10
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:56.100
Your results in one place. Sample data shown.

11
00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:06.100
Your AI team recommends what's next, with the evidence — and waits for your yes.

12
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:14.000
Your AI advertising team is ready. Build your free ad plan.
